-- Migration 33: one-time embedding claim for sources approved through review
-- (ChatBot5400).
--
-- A contributor's submission is processed with embedding off and must be
-- embedded exactly once when it is both approved and has extracted text. The
-- approval and the processing job race, so each side claims the embedding with
-- a single conditional UPDATE that flips this flag (see
-- Source.claim_review_embed). Optional: existing rows stay valid.
DEFINE FIELD IF NOT EXISTS approval_embed_queued ON TABLE source TYPE option<bool>;
